# Clariva: line endings are normalised in the repository; Windows checkouts are CRLF, but files that run on Linux
# (Docker build, nginx, shell scripts) must be checked out with LF.
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
*.locations text eol=lf
*.locations.example text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
